  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "After 6 years, Cho-Ryeong returns, and her childhood friend Gwi-Myeong, who she thought was dead, is alive. And she has become a shaman. Gwi-Myeong has become so cold compared to when she was young. What happened in the meantime? Why do the spirits of the dead keep possessing the bodies of the living in this village? She must look deeply into the stories of the dead and the people left behind to find the secrets hidden by Cho-Ryeong and the Cho-Ryeong Shrine. And also, a way to save Gwi-Myeong.\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
